    "lawCode": "Amd Art 13-BB Art Head, §277, Gen Muni L",
    "lawSection": "General Municipal Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S3322\n\nSPONSOR: LAVALLE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the general municipal law, in relation to including\nlakes in adopt-a-municipal park, shoreline or roadway programs\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nAdd lakes to those areas that are eligible to participate in the Munici-\npal Adoption Program.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 277 of the General Municipal Law that provides for agreements\nwith volunteer groups for adopt-a-municipal park,shoreline or roadway\nshall be amended to include lakes.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nMany communities have lakes that can become littered and unsightly.\nThis bill would expand the present statute to allow these areas to be\nthe subject of agreements under which volunteers could maintain a beau-\ntiful resource.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2017-18 S.2469/A.8599;\n2015-16 S.3954/A.5473;\n2013-14 S.4733A/A.6802A;\n2011-12 S.5073\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect on the sixtieth day it shall have become a\nlaw.\n",
